			"Message": "feat(Wind): Add dev-log forwarding from TypeScript to Mountain\n\nAdd a _DevLogForward helper that mirrors tagged log lines into Mountain's dev-log file sink via the RenderDevLog Tauri command. Integrate it into TauriChannel's three code paths:\n- Fire-and-forget channel invocations\n- Stub hits (when a mocked response is used)\n- Misses (when neither route nor stub exists)\n\nThis enables `LAND_DEV_LOG=<tag> tail -f Mountain.dev.log` to capture TypeScript-originated IPC traffic alongside Rust dev_log! output for better local development debugging.",
			"SHA": "d7daf83f6c42a66a4bf4522b293cd96014549d8f"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-23T15:31:40Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1049,
				2
			],
			"Message": "fix(Wind): Remove deprecated IPC channels and add diagnostics stub\n\nConsolidate SkyEvent channels onto canonical kebab-case forms:\n- Remove StatusBarMessage (fork of StatusBarSetMessage)\n- Remove TreeViewRegister (fork of TreeViewCreate)\n- Remove WebviewPostMessageCamelCase / WebviewSetHTMLCamelCase (forks)\n\nAdd diagnostics stub to prevent TypeError in language detection. The\nlanguageDetectionWorkerServiceImpl synchronously calls\ngetWorkspaceFileExtensions which returns undefined without a stub,\ncausing 'undefined is not an object' when iterating extensions.\n\nThe stub returns empty shapes matching the expected interface, allowing\nlanguage detection to proceed without workspace-derived biases.",
			"SHA": "1e943100e0bdd74a1a17933f7e4ead2e33f7a3b6"
		},
